WEBVTT

01:32.080 --> 01:34.720
On the surface,
Bai Sheng is just a merchant.

01:35.680 --> 01:37.920
His appearance in Yizhou as a businessman

01:38.000 --> 01:39.840
is certainly no coincidence.

01:40.360 --> 01:41.520
Since that's the case,

01:41.600 --> 01:43.840
I still have a role
to play in this matter.

01:43.920 --> 01:45.720
Are you planning to continue
doing business with him?

01:47.800 --> 01:49.040
This Bai Sheng…

01:49.120 --> 01:50.360
As far as I am concerned,

01:50.440 --> 01:51.480
he's more interested in you

01:52.520 --> 01:54.360
than in business.

02:00.000 --> 02:01.960
You really get jealous of everyone, huh?

02:03.280 --> 02:05.200
But I'm already married to you.

02:07.920 --> 02:11.000
I trust you, of course,
but I don't trust him.

02:18.120 --> 02:19.120
Neither do I.

02:20.480 --> 02:21.600
But I trust you.

02:27.000 --> 02:28.120
Then, promise me,

02:28.200 --> 02:31.480
you won't act impulsively
or put yourself in danger.

02:32.400 --> 02:34.360
I'll just focus on business.

02:34.440 --> 02:36.360
If I find any clues, it'll be great.

02:36.440 --> 02:38.320
If not, I won't force it.

02:39.040 --> 02:40.320
I absolutely won't take any risks.

02:40.400 --> 02:41.960
Does that put your mind at ease?

03:31.280 --> 03:32.880
Madam, did you call me over

03:32.960 --> 03:35.400
because I offended Second Uncle today?

03:37.400 --> 03:39.000
I'm aware of what happened.

03:39.960 --> 03:41.240
It wasn't an offense.

03:43.280 --> 03:44.560
Your Second Uncle

03:45.840 --> 03:47.320
has his own faults.

03:48.480 --> 03:51.640
The reason I called you
has nothing to do with him.

03:53.240 --> 03:54.360
Then, what is it about?

03:55.520 --> 03:56.880
It's about the reputation
of the Yang family.

03:59.040 --> 04:02.480
The relatives have complaints
about today's events.

04:04.000 --> 04:05.600
I know you feel wronged,

04:07.320 --> 04:08.960
and I know you're talented,

04:10.960 --> 04:13.240
but contributing to Yizhou

04:13.320 --> 04:15.880
doesn't necessarily mean
contributing to the Yang family.

04:19.360 --> 04:20.279
Madam,

04:21.200 --> 04:23.280
I also want to contribute
to the Yang family,

04:23.960 --> 04:26.480
but I am not empowered.

04:27.080 --> 04:30.120
Now, I'm no longer
the president of the Bloom Society.

04:30.680 --> 04:32.280
As I want to help the Yang family to grow,

04:32.800 --> 04:35.320
what other ways can be used?

04:35.400 --> 04:36.960
Please guide me.

04:42.160 --> 04:44.880
Jinglan has a few shops under his name.

04:45.920 --> 04:47.920
Since he's often away,

04:48.000 --> 04:50.680
the family has been
managing them on his behalf.

04:52.000 --> 04:53.480
If you have time to spare,

04:54.000 --> 04:56.840
perhaps you could take over.

04:56.920 --> 04:58.280
Would you be willing to do that?

04:59.720 --> 05:02.800
I'd be happy to. Thank you, Madam.

05:05.080 --> 05:06.040
Very well.

05:06.920 --> 05:10.520
I'll start arranging the handover.

05:12.960 --> 05:13.880
Yingying,

05:16.280 --> 05:19.320
doing business in the Yang family
is different from outside.

05:20.800 --> 05:22.280
You need to know not only business

05:23.120 --> 05:26.400
but also the rules and social etiquette.

05:29.080 --> 05:30.080
I understand.

05:43.120 --> 05:44.720
Ji Yingying,

05:45.360 --> 05:47.240
how dare you disrespect me like that?

05:48.520 --> 05:50.000
Just you wait!

06:01.680 --> 06:04.000
Who are you? What do you want?

06:04.080 --> 06:05.200
Let me tell you,

06:05.280 --> 06:07.640
my nephew is a registered official
of the Tang Empire.

06:07.720 --> 06:09.840
You'd better not act recklessly!

06:11.320 --> 06:13.280
My people acted inappropriately.

06:13.880 --> 06:15.400
Apologies for the offense, Sir Yang.

06:15.920 --> 06:17.320
Please, have a seat.

06:23.280 --> 06:24.640
I know who you are.

06:26.280 --> 06:29.440
Aren't you that foreign merchant,
Bai Sheng?

06:35.760 --> 06:38.040
Why did you kidnap me?

06:41.760 --> 06:45.360
Actually, in my opinion,

06:45.440 --> 06:50.200
you're far more capable than Master Yang.

06:51.280 --> 06:52.400
Unfortunately,

06:53.120 --> 06:55.640
right now, in the Yang family,

06:55.720 --> 06:57.720
you not only can't take charge,

06:57.800 --> 07:01.600
but you also have to obey
the orders of a woman like Mrs. Yang.

07:02.680 --> 07:04.840
And now, with Ji Yingying joining in,

07:05.360 --> 07:09.520
your status in the Yang family
has sunk even lower.

07:09.600 --> 07:12.400
Well, what do you mean by that?

07:13.520 --> 07:14.800
I mean nothing.

07:15.320 --> 07:16.760
I'm just thinking…

07:16.840 --> 07:20.000
I want to give you the position

07:20.600 --> 07:21.600
of head of the Yang family.

07:23.800 --> 07:24.920
What did you say?

07:25.760 --> 07:27.520
Head of the family?

07:28.120 --> 07:29.440
Give it to me?

07:29.520 --> 07:32.120
Stop spouting nonsense.

07:32.200 --> 07:34.160
Do you think the position of family head

07:35.000 --> 07:38.480
is like one of your backyard
potted plants and you can

07:38.560 --> 07:40.360
give it away as you like?

07:41.440 --> 07:42.960
It's just a collaboration.

07:43.040 --> 07:46.360
Now that you're here, why not hear me out?

07:46.960 --> 07:48.120
Never.

07:49.960 --> 07:54.360
The matters of the Yang family
are for the Yang family alone.

07:54.440 --> 07:57.440
I'll never conspire with an outsider!

07:59.120 --> 08:01.440
Aren't you worried the Yang family
will be taken over by Ms. Ji?

08:09.120 --> 08:12.840
It seems you do care
about this opportunity.

08:19.320 --> 08:21.480
What exactly do you want?

08:23.600 --> 08:26.000
No rush. Have a seat.

08:26.080 --> 08:29.400
Let's discuss this in detail.

08:55.840 --> 08:59.520
ZHAO RESIDENCE

09:08.040 --> 09:09.840
You openly entered my residence.

09:10.520 --> 09:14.240
Are you afraid outsiders won't know
about our relationship?

09:15.040 --> 09:19.520
These days, many people already know
that I am captivated by Shu brocade.

09:20.320 --> 09:21.920
In Yizhou City,

09:22.000 --> 09:25.000
I've met with the Yu family
and the Yang family.

09:25.760 --> 09:28.480
If I deliberately avoid your Zhao family,
the Brocade Master,

09:28.560 --> 09:30.840
wouldn't that raise even more suspicion

09:30.920 --> 09:32.400
from an outsider's perspective?

09:35.200 --> 09:38.280
So, why have you come to me this time?

09:40.840 --> 09:44.080
Since I'm here, there must be reasons.

09:45.760 --> 09:48.280
All the Yang family's merchants
in Chang'an

09:49.560 --> 09:51.040
are listed in this booklet.

09:55.920 --> 09:57.120
Where did this come from?

09:59.400 --> 10:02.760
Once you return from Chang'an,
you'll know that.

10:05.000 --> 10:06.520
You want me to go to Chang'an?

10:07.160 --> 10:09.720
You need to rally all the merchants there

10:09.800 --> 10:13.160
and have them exclusively buy
the Zhao family's brocade from now on

10:13.240 --> 10:15.120
to ruin the Yang family's business

10:15.200 --> 10:16.680
and throw them into chaos,

10:16.760 --> 10:20.400
which will cause Ji Yingying
to have nowhere left to hide.

10:22.760 --> 10:24.560
But the Yang family
has been in business for years,

10:24.640 --> 10:25.720
with a wide and deep network.

10:26.800 --> 10:28.800
How could it collapse so easily?

10:31.920 --> 10:33.200
That depends

10:34.800 --> 10:36.760
on your capabilities.

10:53.880 --> 10:54.880
I want you to finance

10:55.560 --> 10:57.400
a batch of the trendiest
Yang family's brocade

10:58.240 --> 10:59.400
and send it to Chang'an.

11:01.120 --> 11:03.600
So, how much are we talking about?

11:04.200 --> 11:05.080
At least 50 bolts.

11:07.800 --> 11:10.120
Well, 50 bolts…

11:11.080 --> 11:15.360
Do you know how much
50 bolts of brocade are worth?

11:16.800 --> 11:18.120
It should be enough

11:18.200 --> 11:19.880
to buy me a governor
secretary position, right?

11:21.040 --> 11:22.680
But I'm quite curious

11:23.200 --> 11:25.920
what you can offer me in return

11:26.760 --> 11:28.120
if I give you the money.

11:39.920 --> 11:41.480
After taking down the Yang family,

11:41.560 --> 11:43.160
I'll leverage the situation to acquire it.

11:44.520 --> 11:45.600
By then,

11:46.280 --> 11:49.720
the entire Yang family
will be handed over to you.

11:50.320 --> 11:51.160
Will that suffice?

11:54.240 --> 11:57.320
Mr. Zhao, that's not how the math works.

11:58.800 --> 12:01.720
I'll give you Ji Yingying,
and you'll give me the Yang family.

12:01.800 --> 12:03.200
That's one deal.

12:03.920 --> 12:07.800
And those 50 bolts of brocade
are another deal entirely.

12:09.760 --> 12:10.720
But fortunately,

12:11.440 --> 12:15.800
there's something on you
that I really want.

12:17.080 --> 12:17.920
What might that be?

12:19.240 --> 12:20.400
The Zhao family's pattern book.

12:25.680 --> 12:26.600
The pattern book

12:27.160 --> 12:28.640
is the foundation
of any brocade household.

12:28.720 --> 12:30.120
If I give it to you,

12:31.480 --> 12:33.640
I might as well hand over
the entire Zhao family to you!

12:34.840 --> 12:37.040
Mr. Zhao, have you ever
cared about the Zhao family?

12:37.120 --> 12:37.960
Forget the Zhao family.

12:38.640 --> 12:40.040
You've never even cared

12:40.120 --> 12:41.360
about the entire
brocade industry in Yizhou City.

12:41.440 --> 12:44.440
All you care about is one person.

12:45.800 --> 12:46.760
And her name is Ji Yingying.

12:46.840 --> 12:48.280
Isn't that right?

12:59.720 --> 13:00.760
The Bloom Society,

13:01.560 --> 13:04.000
the Zhao family,
the Yang family, and the Yu family…

13:05.120 --> 13:06.240
What you're after

13:07.160 --> 13:09.000
is the entire brocade industry of Yizhou!

13:13.280 --> 13:14.800
Who exactly are you?

13:17.120 --> 13:18.160
I am the one

13:18.720 --> 13:21.080
who knows what you want

13:22.680 --> 13:23.920
and can help you achieve it.

13:39.960 --> 13:41.040
Can you manage it?

13:41.920 --> 13:44.400
Dear, am I not capable?

13:49.720 --> 13:51.640
Greetings to Mr. Zhao and Ms. Ji.

13:52.160 --> 13:53.000
My surname is Sun,

13:53.080 --> 13:55.720
and I manage two shops
under Mr. Zhao's name.

13:59.000 --> 14:01.720
The shops are just ahead.
This way, please.

14:03.480 --> 14:07.360
As you can see, those two over there
belong to Mr. Yang Jingshan.

14:07.440 --> 14:09.680
Behind them are Mr. Yang Jinglin's
embroidery shop

14:09.760 --> 14:11.040
and clothing store.

14:11.120 --> 14:13.360
Farther back
are Mr. Yang Jinglin's tea house

14:13.440 --> 14:14.280
and embroidery building.

14:14.880 --> 14:17.200
That's Mr. Yang Jinglan's dyehouse.

14:18.160 --> 14:21.080
The Yang family has many shops
on this street alone.

14:21.160 --> 14:23.120
There are five or six streets like this.

14:25.080 --> 14:26.840
The Yang family is truly prosperous.

14:27.600 --> 14:28.840
No wonder they say
marrying into the Yang family

14:28.920 --> 14:29.880
is your good fortune.

14:30.880 --> 14:33.160
Marrying my wife is the Yang family's
good fortune.

14:33.240 --> 14:34.360
Oh, yes.

14:34.440 --> 14:35.960
It's good fortune for both sides.

14:37.120 --> 14:38.840
Here we are. This is your shop.

14:40.080 --> 14:42.080
YANG

14:50.920 --> 14:51.840
Mr. Sun,

14:52.520 --> 14:55.160
why are these brocades displayed outside?

14:55.240 --> 14:56.080
Well…

14:57.720 --> 14:59.280
Mr. Yang, Ms. Ji,

15:00.040 --> 15:02.840
my capabilities are limited,
and it isn't managed well.

15:02.920 --> 15:04.640
The shop space is too small,

15:04.720 --> 15:06.440
so I have to display some outside.

15:06.520 --> 15:08.680
I hope you both understand.

15:11.560 --> 15:12.560
After you, my dear.

15:18.640 --> 15:21.720
Mr. Sun, could you bring me
the account book?

15:21.800 --> 15:22.880
Of course. One moment.

15:43.920 --> 15:47.160
The craftsmanship is fine,
but the designs are outdated.

15:47.240 --> 15:50.240
Are you planning to do business here,

15:50.320 --> 15:52.080
or shall we go back
and demand an explanation?

15:54.240 --> 15:56.640
Look at this.
The Yang family has a big business,

15:56.720 --> 15:58.960
yet they gave you such a rundown shop.

15:59.720 --> 16:01.560
Besides, Madam Yang must have known

16:01.640 --> 16:02.800
I'd come with you.

16:03.480 --> 16:05.880
I bet they're already prepared
for us to make a scene.

16:08.840 --> 16:10.000
Let me think it over.

16:11.160 --> 16:14.080
Mr. Liu, how many times have I told you?

16:14.160 --> 16:15.120
Our brocade…

16:15.200 --> 16:16.960
- Mr. Liu?
- It can't be sold in small quantities.

16:17.040 --> 16:20.040
For the sake of us all working
for the Yang family,

16:20.120 --> 16:21.440
please sell it to me.

16:22.120 --> 16:23.080
What's going on here?

16:25.360 --> 16:27.120
Mr. Yang, Ms. Ji,

16:28.440 --> 16:30.240
this is Mr. Liu,
a weaver from my household.

16:30.880 --> 16:32.640
His daughter
is getting married next month,

16:32.720 --> 16:34.560
and he wanted to buy some brocade
to make a wedding fan.

16:34.640 --> 16:35.480
But…

16:36.600 --> 16:39.040
Mr. Liu, I'm not trying
to make things difficult,

16:39.120 --> 16:41.280
but it's just not feasible
to sell it in small quantities.

16:41.360 --> 16:44.320
I understand.
I've been asking around all day.

16:44.400 --> 16:45.840
None of the shops

16:45.920 --> 16:48.160
are willing to make such a small sale.

16:48.240 --> 16:51.080
I'd buy more if I could,
but I just can't afford it.

16:51.680 --> 16:52.680
How shameful.

16:52.760 --> 16:53.880
After weaving brocade for so many years,

16:53.960 --> 16:55.000
when my daughter is getting married,

16:55.080 --> 16:56.880
I, her father,

16:56.960 --> 16:59.560
can't even afford
a Shu brocade wedding fan for her.

17:03.640 --> 17:05.440
Go and pick out
a suitable piece of brocade for Mr. Liu.

17:05.520 --> 17:07.160
Mr. Yang, I can't use your money.

17:07.240 --> 17:09.119
How could I possibly accept your kindness?

17:09.200 --> 17:10.440
Go on.

17:11.119 --> 17:13.480
I wouldn't dare take your money.
I'll fetch the brocade.

17:17.680 --> 17:19.520
Mr. Liu, back then,
the Yang family's illegitimate child

17:19.599 --> 17:20.800
wasn't allowed to enter
the brocade workshop.

17:20.880 --> 17:22.480
I was curious and insisted on sneaking in,

17:22.560 --> 17:24.520
and you helped shelter me.
Do you remember?

17:24.599 --> 17:26.359
It's really nothing worth mentioning.

17:26.440 --> 17:28.560
Mr. Yang, you still remember it?

17:28.640 --> 17:29.560
Of course I do.

17:30.160 --> 17:31.200
Mr. Liu,

17:31.280 --> 17:34.320
this is a kind gesture
from Mr. Yang and Ms. Ji.

17:34.400 --> 17:36.000
You should accept it.

17:45.680 --> 17:46.720
Thank you.

17:47.400 --> 17:48.280
There's no need.

17:49.760 --> 17:53.120
May Mr. Yang and Ms. Ji be blessed
with children soon

17:53.200 --> 17:54.560
and enjoy long lives together.

18:27.800 --> 18:28.800
What's on your mind, dear?

18:30.120 --> 18:32.680
I just reviewed the shop's accounts
and noticed some issues.

18:33.640 --> 18:35.480
The revenue is pitifully low.

18:35.560 --> 18:39.720
The inventory is filled with damaged,
outdated brocades

18:40.320 --> 18:41.400
that no one is interested in buying.

18:43.840 --> 18:45.480
So, you weren't thinking about me?

18:48.120 --> 18:50.440
Why would I think about you?
You're well, right?

18:50.960 --> 18:51.920
I…

18:56.680 --> 18:57.600
Actually…

19:01.120 --> 19:02.480
I haven't recovered yet.

19:03.720 --> 19:05.400
I hope my dear will take pity on me.

19:08.600 --> 19:10.840
Look, my dear. My hand

19:11.360 --> 19:13.120
still can't lift anything heavy.

19:21.880 --> 19:22.720
Dear,

19:23.400 --> 19:26.840
to tease someone with such injuries,
isn't that a bit much?

19:31.600 --> 19:32.440
Open your mouth.

19:35.000 --> 19:37.440
That's enough.
Keep this up, and I'll kick you out.

19:40.960 --> 19:43.240
I got injured. Forgive me.

19:43.320 --> 19:45.480
Help me, dear. Sorry for the trouble.

19:46.920 --> 19:50.360
It's only Yingying
who would believe your nonsense.

19:50.440 --> 19:52.320
With that sweet mouth of yours,

19:52.400 --> 19:53.560
how many young ladies
have you sweet-talked?

19:53.640 --> 19:55.160
Yuniang, you've got it wrong.

19:55.800 --> 19:56.920
You've watched me grow up.

19:57.000 --> 19:59.160
When have I ever sweet-talked anyone?

19:59.240 --> 20:00.600
Shut up.

20:00.680 --> 20:02.280
Who watched you grow up?

20:05.240 --> 20:07.360
He hasn't fully recovered yet,
so no drinking.

20:09.720 --> 20:11.560
It's fine. I can drink a little.

20:12.280 --> 20:13.960
Just a little. One…

20:18.000 --> 20:20.480
- Not even a drop?
- What do you think?

20:22.600 --> 20:23.920
Oh, he's not allowed to drink?

20:24.920 --> 20:26.480
Then, why did Zhuge Hong

20:26.560 --> 20:28.400
take two jars of wine
from me the other day?

20:31.080 --> 20:33.560
You didn't drink them? You gave them away?

20:33.640 --> 20:34.680
I see. You gave them away.

20:35.360 --> 20:37.760
Yuniang… Hey…

20:38.320 --> 20:39.560
Yang Jinglan!

20:44.440 --> 20:45.720
I was wrong.

20:45.800 --> 20:48.040
Whether your injuries are better
is up to you.

20:48.120 --> 20:50.080
That's your decision.

20:50.160 --> 20:53.080
But whether you can drink
or not is up to me.

20:53.160 --> 20:54.320
That's my temperament!

20:54.400 --> 20:55.360
Understand?

20:57.400 --> 20:58.920
Got it.

20:59.440 --> 21:01.040
No more drinking. No more at all.

21:01.640 --> 21:03.320
Not even a little.

21:04.440 --> 21:06.560
How about this, dear?
Let's discuss business now.

21:06.640 --> 21:07.600
You've been pondering

21:08.240 --> 21:09.840
over the shop for quite some time.

21:09.920 --> 21:11.000
Are you planning to take it over?

21:17.120 --> 21:19.240
I've never managed
a shop officially before.

21:20.240 --> 21:21.920
Starting with a rundown shop

21:22.000 --> 21:23.160
might be a good way to learn.

21:23.720 --> 21:26.720
Adding the finishing touch
isn't as impactful as saving the day.

21:28.840 --> 21:31.240
Do you have any ideas, dear?

21:32.000 --> 21:34.880
Shu brocade is as precious as gold
and is never sold in small quantities.

21:35.440 --> 21:36.800
Many people like Mr. Liu

21:36.880 --> 21:38.560
have spent half their lives
weaving Shu brocade,

21:38.640 --> 21:41.640
yet they probably can't afford
even a foot of decent brocade.

21:43.000 --> 21:46.640
But to them,
and even to the people of Shu,

21:47.200 --> 21:48.880
Shu brocade carries
extraordinary significance.

21:50.120 --> 21:51.240
The brocades in our shop

21:51.320 --> 21:54.800
might not appeal to wealthy nobles,

21:54.880 --> 21:56.440
but they're still high-quality brocades.

21:57.160 --> 21:58.440
Why don't we…?

21:59.000 --> 22:01.480
Why don't we turn the unsold fragments

22:01.560 --> 22:02.920
into small items,

22:03.440 --> 22:07.200
like jewelry packaging,
sachets, or round fans?

22:07.800 --> 22:10.160
Though they'd cost more
than ordinary pouches,

22:10.240 --> 22:11.800
they'd still be affordable for commoners.

22:13.960 --> 22:15.720
This way, we clear out
old stock and make money,

22:16.280 --> 22:19.680
while letting ordinary people
enjoy the beauty of Shu brocade.

22:19.760 --> 22:20.960
Brilliant idea, my dear.

22:22.000 --> 22:24.720
But relying solely on our shop's brocades
won't be enough.

22:24.800 --> 22:26.440
We need more designs,

22:27.200 --> 22:29.240
new or old, big or small,

22:29.320 --> 22:32.280
as long as they're visually appealing
and reasonably priced.

22:35.040 --> 22:36.440
You seem to have made up your mind, dear.

22:45.640 --> 22:47.440
The 50 bolts of Yang family brocade
you requested,

22:47.520 --> 22:50.400
along with the cart,
are 20 miles outside the city.

22:51.200 --> 22:53.720
This jade pendant is your token.
Take it with you.

22:53.800 --> 22:56.600
Let it accompany you to Chang'an.

22:58.840 --> 23:00.520
Being able to mobilize such a sum

23:01.080 --> 23:03.360
in such a short time…

23:04.080 --> 23:05.560
It seems you're as rich as a kingdom.

23:07.600 --> 23:10.040
Are you really just a simple merchant?

23:12.600 --> 23:14.880
Mr. Zhao, you're betting everything
for the one you love,

23:14.960 --> 23:16.080
risking it all.

23:16.160 --> 23:18.640
Actually, we are the same type of person.

23:18.720 --> 23:21.360
The only difference is
I want much more than you do.

23:21.440 --> 23:24.200
So, my stakes are naturally higher.

23:28.240 --> 23:29.480
Half of the Zhao family's
secret pattern book

23:29.560 --> 23:30.880
is in this box.

23:30.960 --> 23:32.600
The other half

23:32.680 --> 23:34.120
will be handed over
once the matter is settled.

23:35.000 --> 23:36.080
Good.

23:36.160 --> 23:40.040
Then I wish you a smooth journey.

23:40.640 --> 23:42.920
The Chang'an matter
won't be resolved in a day or two.

23:44.440 --> 23:45.480
What do you plan to do

23:46.120 --> 23:47.840
in Yizhou in the meantime?

23:53.240 --> 23:56.360
Though the Yang family
is currently managed by Madam Yang,

23:56.880 --> 23:59.840
even she has to answer
to the Yang family elders.

24:00.640 --> 24:03.600
Yang Jinglan has refused their goodwill.

24:03.680 --> 24:05.040
As for Ji Yingying,

24:05.120 --> 24:08.400
she's gathered old and scrap brocades
from various households.

24:08.480 --> 24:10.880
You know her personality well.

24:10.960 --> 24:13.040
She's not one to act without a plan.

24:13.120 --> 24:14.480
She must have a backup move.

24:15.880 --> 24:17.440
As soon as she makes the slightest move,

24:17.520 --> 24:21.680
the Yang family elders
will use family rules against her.

24:23.280 --> 24:24.960
These elders…

24:25.040 --> 24:26.800
their interests
and preferences rarely align,

24:26.880 --> 24:29.200
but when it comes to disliking someone,

24:29.280 --> 24:30.720
they are surprisingly united.

24:30.800 --> 24:32.720
To them, there's only one truth.

24:33.280 --> 24:35.920
The enemy of my enemy is my friend.

24:37.800 --> 24:39.360
You bribed Yang Jinglan's
Send Uncle, didn't you?

24:41.720 --> 24:43.480
No wonder they call you
the Zhao family head.

24:43.560 --> 24:44.960
You certainly have your sources.

24:46.840 --> 24:49.240
As the head of the Zhao family,
my abilities are limited.

24:49.760 --> 24:52.000
However, I've asked
my father-in-law for a favor.

24:52.680 --> 24:54.200
Even if he's not in Yizhou,

24:54.280 --> 24:55.920
he can still ensure your safety here.

24:56.640 --> 24:57.800
Very well.

24:59.320 --> 25:00.280
Then,

25:01.640 --> 25:03.960
- I wish you all the best.
- All the best.

25:11.800 --> 25:13.320
- Farewell.
- I won't see you out.

25:37.240 --> 25:38.200
Sir,

25:41.920 --> 25:45.240
Zhao Xiuyuan seems
to be doubting your identity.

25:46.720 --> 25:48.720
He doesn't care about my identity.

25:48.800 --> 25:51.600
What he cares about
is how to restrain his allies.

25:52.840 --> 25:53.680
Let him be.

25:54.640 --> 25:55.480
Oh,

25:56.000 --> 25:57.440
do you know

25:57.520 --> 26:00.080
where the other half
of the Zhao family's pattern book is?

26:00.160 --> 26:01.920
Our men have been
keeping watch day and night.

26:03.240 --> 26:05.600
Last night, when Zhao Xiuyuan
retrieved the pattern book,

26:05.680 --> 26:07.120
they pinpointed its location.

26:07.200 --> 26:09.320
Once Zhao Xiuyuan leaves for Chang'an,

26:09.400 --> 26:12.040
we'll infiltrate and make a copy
as soon as possible.

26:19.920 --> 26:20.760
If you have something to say,
speak freely.

26:20.840 --> 26:22.360
- You won't be punished.
- Understood.

26:24.520 --> 26:25.360
Sir,

26:25.960 --> 26:27.360
your trip this time

26:27.440 --> 26:29.840
was to strengthen
our Nanzhao brocade industry.

26:30.440 --> 26:33.400
The craftsmen and the pattern books
we've secured

26:33.480 --> 26:34.880
are already more than sufficient.

26:35.920 --> 26:37.960
Do we really need to acquire
the Yang family's patterns?

26:38.560 --> 26:40.520
Now that Yang Jinglan is watching us,

26:41.360 --> 26:43.600
and even Niu Jin
is avoiding confrontation,

26:44.640 --> 26:47.080
why not withdraw early

26:47.160 --> 26:48.440
and return to Nanzhao?

26:52.160 --> 26:53.080
Forgive my crossing the lines.

26:55.920 --> 26:57.480
Enough. Stand up.

26:58.640 --> 26:59.640
You're right.

27:00.520 --> 27:02.120
At this point, we do have enough.

27:02.200 --> 27:04.320
But before I set out,

27:04.400 --> 27:06.600
I said I wanted it all.

27:06.680 --> 27:09.640
So, I must have it all.

27:11.040 --> 27:12.080
That's human nature.

27:12.800 --> 27:15.000
Once you get used
to compromise and retreat,

27:15.080 --> 27:18.560
you'll never reach the summit.

27:20.480 --> 27:21.400
Understood.

27:34.680 --> 27:36.240
Delicate and compact,

27:37.040 --> 27:39.240
both beautiful and practical.

27:43.360 --> 27:44.360
Not bad at all.

27:49.640 --> 27:50.640
Yingying,

27:52.040 --> 27:55.840
you're certainly not the first
to have this idea.

27:56.440 --> 27:59.560
But do you know
why no one has done it before?

28:00.720 --> 28:01.760
Is it because

28:02.520 --> 28:04.400
the profit margin
for scrap brocade is so small

28:04.480 --> 28:05.640
that they don't think it's worth it?

28:06.920 --> 28:07.760
No.

28:11.840 --> 28:13.040
It's because of mindset.

28:14.000 --> 28:16.800
Just like peddlers and laborers

28:16.880 --> 28:20.120
don't dare dream of owning Shu brocade.

28:20.920 --> 28:23.680
But mindsets are created from nothing.

28:23.760 --> 28:25.600
As long as it doesn't
violate morals or ethics,

28:25.680 --> 28:27.080
it has its reason to exist.

28:28.000 --> 28:29.840
By turning scrap brocade into small items,

28:29.920 --> 28:31.320
we avoid waste

28:31.400 --> 28:33.880
and let the common people
enjoy the beauty of Shu brocade.

28:33.960 --> 28:34.800
Why not do it?

28:36.600 --> 28:39.480
Having ideas in business is a good thing,

28:40.560 --> 28:43.920
but any new path comes with controversy.

28:44.520 --> 28:45.680
You must think it through.

28:47.200 --> 28:49.480
I've thought it through.
I want to give it a try.

28:50.440 --> 28:51.800
With what resources?

28:52.400 --> 28:56.440
Just the outdated
brocade samples in your shop?

28:57.200 --> 28:58.720
My two brothers-in-law have already agreed

28:58.800 --> 29:01.240
to sell me unsellable brocades

29:01.320 --> 29:03.960
and scraps from the clothing shop
at a low price.

29:04.800 --> 29:06.880
It's no surprise Yang Jinshan agreed,

29:06.960 --> 29:09.880
but how did you convince Yang Jinglin?

29:10.880 --> 29:12.240
I convinced his wife.

29:17.600 --> 29:19.480
You sure know
how to target the key person.

29:42.600 --> 29:44.160
You didn't even cover yourself
before coming out.

29:55.600 --> 29:56.600
You might catch a cold again.

30:06.960 --> 30:08.080
Sit down.

30:12.080 --> 30:13.640
You're serious about this, aren't you?

30:15.880 --> 30:17.880
Ms. Ji never lies.

30:19.360 --> 30:22.320
Now that you're a boss,
you're still doing all this yourself?

30:22.400 --> 30:25.400
I wanted to try
doing some of it myself first.

30:25.480 --> 30:28.560
If I can make a name for it,
I'll ask Mr. Liu for help

30:28.640 --> 30:30.200
and then share the profits with him.

30:30.280 --> 30:33.360
He's a weaver,
so he'd definitely be good at this.

30:33.960 --> 30:36.040
Don't underestimate these scrap brocades.

30:36.120 --> 30:38.800
How to cut them to preserve
the patterns better,

30:38.880 --> 30:40.200
how to prevent loose threads,

30:40.280 --> 30:42.000
and how to make them stick more securely…

30:42.080 --> 30:43.360
These are all skills to learn.

30:44.640 --> 30:45.480
Then let me help you.

30:46.160 --> 30:47.320
You know how to do it?

30:48.680 --> 30:49.920
I can wield a sword,

30:51.080 --> 30:52.600
but I can't even handle scissors?

30:54.080 --> 30:56.560
- It's not the same thing.
- How is it not the same thing?

30:56.640 --> 30:57.560
All right…

30:58.600 --> 31:01.240
Mr. Yang, Ms. Ji, it's time to rest.

31:02.040 --> 31:03.440
My helper has arrived.

31:04.200 --> 31:05.200
Come in!

31:11.160 --> 31:12.240
Greetings, Mr. Yang, Ms. Ji.

31:14.400 --> 31:16.880
Mr. Yang, Ms. Ji, it's getting late.

31:16.960 --> 31:18.120
Please rest early.

31:19.360 --> 31:20.920
But I still have so much left to do.

31:21.000 --> 31:23.600
The Yang family rules
forbid unnecessary overwork.

31:23.680 --> 31:24.960
You must take care of your health.

31:25.040 --> 31:26.400
You should leave it for tomorrow.

31:26.480 --> 31:29.720
I remember one
of the Yang family's rules is

31:29.800 --> 31:32.680
to share the master's burdens
and endure hardships together.

31:33.840 --> 31:34.680
Did you forget it?

31:36.280 --> 31:37.160
Then, let me help you.

31:38.360 --> 31:39.520
All right.

31:40.280 --> 31:41.120
Yes.

31:43.640 --> 31:44.920
For those who follow the rules,

31:45.000 --> 31:46.320
their cuts must be precise and square.

31:46.920 --> 31:49.360
Dear, you truly know
how to utilize people well.

31:51.960 --> 31:54.640
All right, I have a helper now.
You should go rest.

31:55.760 --> 31:58.440
No, I'm not going back.

31:59.960 --> 32:03.960
Tomorrow, your husband
will return to the Brocade Bureau,

32:04.520 --> 32:06.920
rising early, working late,
and not coming home at night.

32:08.600 --> 32:11.200
So, tonight, let me stay here

32:11.280 --> 32:12.520
and look at you properly.

32:20.640 --> 32:21.600
Let me help you instead.

32:23.480 --> 32:25.480
Didn't you say you wanted to look at me?

32:26.360 --> 32:27.240
Fine,

32:27.920 --> 32:30.840
then I'll just look at you.

32:54.640 --> 32:55.560
Sir!

32:57.960 --> 32:59.760
It's so late. Why are you here?

33:00.960 --> 33:03.680
I was just passing by
and saw the lights were on,

33:03.760 --> 33:05.280
and the door was left open,

33:05.360 --> 33:08.360
so I thought…
This is the Yang family's new venture.

33:08.440 --> 33:11.240
As the head of the family,
don't I have to come take a look?

33:12.760 --> 33:14.680
Yes, of course. Please, come in.

33:16.120 --> 33:17.360
Learn from her!

33:24.760 --> 33:25.760
Let's go.

33:26.520 --> 33:28.120
Are you sticking brocade boxes?

33:28.200 --> 33:30.480
Now this is something I'm good at!

33:31.640 --> 33:33.920
Come. Let me stick one for you.

33:34.520 --> 33:35.600
Thank you, sir.

33:37.960 --> 33:39.000
- Well…
- Sit down.

33:47.560 --> 33:50.840
You've really made something of yourself.
This is a good thing.

33:53.600 --> 33:55.240
Don't worry about Niu Jin.

33:56.120 --> 33:58.880
Our family offers tribute
to the military commissioner every year.

33:58.960 --> 34:01.120
No matter how arrogant Niu Jin is,

34:01.200 --> 34:05.320
he won't destroy
the commissioner's cash cow.

34:10.679 --> 34:13.080
Indeed. Thank you, sir.

34:13.159 --> 34:15.800
The Yang family elders

34:17.000 --> 34:18.679
are still the same as ever,

34:18.760 --> 34:21.679
greedy and obsessed with appearances.

34:23.280 --> 34:27.760
Right now,
they both need you and fear you.

34:27.840 --> 34:30.360
No matter how high your rank is outside,

34:31.239 --> 34:32.920
once you return to the Yang family,

34:33.600 --> 34:37.560
they'll use all kinds of family ethics

34:37.639 --> 34:39.520
and clan rules to suppress you.

34:40.800 --> 34:42.360
Just seeing these people annoys me.

34:43.239 --> 34:45.280
That's why I stay far away from them.

34:45.960 --> 34:49.480
But if you ever run into trouble,
just push it onto me.

34:50.080 --> 34:52.239
After all, I'm still
the head of the family.

34:52.880 --> 34:54.360
All right, we understand.

34:55.239 --> 34:57.280
Sir, the sticker is crooked.

34:58.520 --> 34:59.360
Crooked?

35:00.600 --> 35:01.440
Useless.

35:04.040 --> 35:06.840
I'm useless here,
but I do have my uses elsewhere.

35:11.040 --> 35:13.240
Look at this brocade box.

35:14.120 --> 35:17.560
If the sticker is crooked,
you can peel it off and stick it again.

35:19.160 --> 35:22.040
But a person, when they make a mistake,

35:23.280 --> 35:27.000
can't they get a second chance?

35:33.280 --> 35:34.640
In this lifetime,

35:36.920 --> 35:38.440
what I regret most,

35:39.120 --> 35:40.600
what I feel most sorry about,

35:40.680 --> 35:44.560
is not understanding
what your mother truly needed.

35:45.480 --> 35:47.800
Now that you're back,

35:48.840 --> 35:50.080
can't you…

35:52.200 --> 35:55.760
Can't you give me a chance
to get to know my own son?

36:03.000 --> 36:04.600
Sir, don't rush.

36:04.680 --> 36:07.040
We've just returned to the Yang family.

36:07.120 --> 36:08.520
Take everything slowly.

36:10.120 --> 36:12.240
How can I not be anxious?

36:12.320 --> 36:14.000
Whenever there's even
a slight opportunity,

36:14.080 --> 36:15.800
I rush over excitedly.

36:18.240 --> 36:20.320
And yet, someone doesn't appreciate it.

36:20.400 --> 36:22.160
I haven't even eaten yet.

36:34.240 --> 36:35.120
You must be cold.

36:36.800 --> 36:37.680
Here's what we'll do.

36:38.240 --> 36:40.960
I'll make you some wontons
to warm you both up.

36:50.480 --> 36:52.000
Did he just say

36:54.520 --> 36:55.520
"you both"?

36:57.120 --> 36:59.000
Yes, "you both".

37:01.240 --> 37:02.520
It's "you both"!

37:06.040 --> 37:07.960
- Take it slow.
- Take it slow.

37:10.560 --> 37:15.720
YIZHOU

37:17.440 --> 37:20.200
Shu brocade pouches! Brocade boxes!

37:20.280 --> 37:21.680
Come take a look, everyone!

37:21.760 --> 37:23.000
All made from Shu brocade!

37:23.680 --> 37:26.640
Come and see!
Look how beautiful these pouches are!

37:26.720 --> 37:27.560
Come on.

37:31.880 --> 37:32.720
Mr. Bai.

37:37.160 --> 37:39.320
How much are these Shu brocade pouches?

37:40.400 --> 37:41.440
Twenty wen each.

37:43.000 --> 37:44.080
Which one did you embroider?

37:44.160 --> 37:47.240
There's no distinction.
Whichever one you pick is the one.

37:48.800 --> 37:50.320
If I'm not mistaken,

37:50.400 --> 37:52.320
these must be made by you

37:53.040 --> 37:55.760
using scrap brocade
from the clothing shop.

38:03.160 --> 38:06.040
You truly have a talent for business.

38:06.800 --> 38:09.360
That pouch's embroidery isn't very good.
Pick another.

38:09.440 --> 38:10.360
No need.

38:10.440 --> 38:13.480
I've heard your embroidery skills

38:14.560 --> 38:15.680
have never been particularly good.

38:22.120 --> 38:22.960
Thank you.

38:30.800 --> 38:33.320
- Hello there.
- What a delicate brocade box!

38:33.400 --> 38:35.240
- How much is it?
- Thirty wen each.

38:35.320 --> 38:36.640
That's so expensive!

38:36.720 --> 38:38.040
Is it made of gold?

38:39.120 --> 38:41.800
It's made from the brocade
of the former Brocade Master,

38:41.880 --> 38:43.280
the Yang family, in Yizhou City.

38:44.400 --> 38:45.800
Miss, do you still think it's expensive?

38:47.120 --> 38:48.440
Is this really made from
the Yang family brocade?

38:48.520 --> 38:49.880
No tricks or deception here.

38:49.960 --> 38:52.120
When did the Yang family
start selling these things?

38:52.200 --> 38:54.760
Madam Yang is compassionate
towards the people of Yizhou.

38:54.840 --> 38:57.520
People admire the beauty of Shu brocade,
but few can afford to use it.

38:58.200 --> 39:00.320
So, we crafted these items
from scrap brocade.

39:00.400 --> 39:03.440
Though the price is a bit high,
it's still affordable for everyone.

39:03.520 --> 39:06.000
This way, more or less,
everyone can experience Shu brocade.

39:06.600 --> 39:08.360
The Yang family is truly
a renowned brocade household,

39:08.440 --> 39:10.120
kind-hearted and generous.

39:10.200 --> 39:11.240
I'll take this brocade box.

39:11.840 --> 39:13.720
Now I can say I own some Shu brocade too.

39:13.800 --> 39:14.640
Exactly.

39:15.680 --> 39:17.280
This pouch here is made
from the Yang family brocade.

39:17.360 --> 39:18.520
It's made from the Yang family brocade?

39:18.600 --> 39:21.120
- Yeah. It's made from Yang family brocade.
- How much is it?

39:21.200 --> 39:22.240
All right.

39:25.400 --> 39:26.240
Come again!

39:27.280 --> 39:28.360
Want to check out
the brocade boxes as well?

39:29.760 --> 39:31.520
This brocade box is no longer for sale.

39:33.240 --> 39:34.520
Each brocade box is 30 wen.

39:38.840 --> 39:41.680
This brocade box is not for sale!

39:43.400 --> 39:46.480
Second Uncle, if you want a brocade box,
you can pick another.

39:46.560 --> 39:49.200
This one was already chosen
by this young lady.

39:49.280 --> 39:51.120
Not only is this one not for sale,

39:51.200 --> 39:52.920
but all the ones sold already.

39:53.000 --> 39:54.960
I want them bought back
at double the price.

39:55.040 --> 39:55.880
Understood.

39:56.480 --> 39:57.680
Second Uncle, what do you mean by this?

39:58.560 --> 39:59.680
What do I mean?

40:01.160 --> 40:03.680
Yang family brocade

40:03.760 --> 40:05.160
is not sold piecemeal!

40:08.600 --> 40:11.480
I cannot just stand by
and watch this, Ms. Ji.

40:11.560 --> 40:13.320
You'll make a grave mistake!

40:13.840 --> 40:17.720
So, I'm here to mend the situation.

40:18.760 --> 40:21.640
Sir, could this be a misunderstanding?

40:21.720 --> 40:23.760
Who gives you the right to speak?

40:26.640 --> 40:27.880
Pack everything up.

40:27.960 --> 40:28.960
Hold on!

40:30.840 --> 40:33.880
My scrap brocade business
was approved by both Sir and Madam.

40:35.200 --> 40:37.480
Does Second Uncle's authority

40:37.560 --> 40:39.320
surpass that of the family head
and the steward?

40:42.560 --> 40:43.400
Listen to me.

40:43.480 --> 40:48.840
My sister-in-law manages household affairs
with great effort.

40:48.920 --> 40:51.240
She is bound to make occasional mistakes.

40:51.320 --> 40:53.160
My eldest brother…

40:55.200 --> 40:58.520
was deceived
by this pretentious act of yours!

41:00.400 --> 41:04.040
I, as a Yang family elder,

41:04.120 --> 41:06.160
have the right to supervise!

41:07.320 --> 41:10.520
I absolutely cannot allow
a mere junior like you

41:10.600 --> 41:11.560
to disgrace

41:12.560 --> 41:15.480
the Yang family.

41:18.760 --> 41:20.320
What if I refuse to comply?

41:26.480 --> 41:27.600
Pack it up.

41:31.760 --> 41:33.680
Thank you, Second Uncle,
for supporting my business.

41:33.760 --> 41:35.640
That'll be 300 wen.

41:35.720 --> 41:36.600
Please pay in cash.

41:36.680 --> 41:38.880
- Pay up!
- What?

41:38.960 --> 41:40.560
Pay up!

41:40.640 --> 41:42.000
- Pay up!
- Pay up!

41:42.080 --> 41:43.960
Ji Yingying!

41:44.560 --> 41:46.360
My Second Uncle is wealthy.

41:46.440 --> 41:48.600
He wouldn't lower himself
to taking from a nephew's wife.

41:48.680 --> 41:50.400
That would disgrace the Yang family.

41:50.480 --> 41:53.600
- Exactly.
- Pay up!

41:53.680 --> 41:55.560
- Pay up!
- Pay up!

41:55.640 --> 41:57.360
Did I say I wouldn't pay?

41:57.440 --> 41:58.880
I'll pay.

42:00.800 --> 42:02.960
I'll pay you. Just you wait.

42:04.400 --> 42:05.360
This isn't over.

42:07.240 --> 42:08.160
Thank you, Second Uncle.

42:12.200 --> 42:14.000
He is always domineering at home.

42:14.080 --> 42:16.400
Ms. Ji, you must be careful.

42:17.320 --> 42:19.320
I am not easily bullied.

42:20.320 --> 42:21.600
Sold out for the day. Pack up.

42:22.200 --> 42:23.600
- Take the money.
- All right.

42:24.800 --> 42:25.680
Let's go.

42:32.600 --> 42:35.400
Although today's matter isn't a big deal,

42:36.120 --> 42:37.960
with a little instigation,

42:38.040 --> 42:43.040
it could become the start
of a conflict between Ji Yingying

42:43.120 --> 42:44.400
and the Yang family elders.

42:46.640 --> 42:49.600
That pouch wasn't part
of your plan, was it?

42:52.560 --> 42:53.960
You and I may be cooperating,

42:54.040 --> 42:56.000
but some things are yours,

42:56.080 --> 42:57.120
while some things

42:59.920 --> 43:01.040
don't belong to you.
